  "summary_en": "European Parliament STOA study analysing how the GDPR applies to AI, covering purpose limitation, data minimisation, legal bases, profiling, automated decision-making, explanation rights and data protection by design. It concludes AI can comply with the GDPR, but the GDPR gives insufficient guidance and needs to be expanded and concretised.",
